# Selected-range Knot clipping through the real static Genet session.
#
# The harness serves scenarios/fixtures/knot_authoring on 127.0.0.1:18765 and
# configures TURNSTONE_KNOT_ROOT plus TURNSTONE_KNOT_CLIP_TARGET with the
# target's advertised file:/// address for a writable directory endpoint.
# Genet resolves the phrase to retained caret geometry;
# Probe then drives the ordinary press/move/release route before Inspector sends
# the resulting typed range clip through Knot.
settle 10
key escape
open http://127.0.0.1:18765/clip_source.html
settle 20
act Toggle live content
settle 20
assert content-live
select-text only this linked finding
act Open Inspector pane
settle 5
assert text Knot clip: ready
click role:button Clip document
settle 300
assert text Knot clip: clip saved
capture knot_selected_clip
log Selected-range clipping crossed Genet Probe, Inspector, and Knot authority
